// HexTactics prototype map (spec part 2): 12 columns x 10 rows of FLAT-TOP hexes, odd-q offsets
// (odd columns lie half a hex lower than even ones). One text line per row, one token per column.
// Tokens: .  walkable   #  blocked   B  player base   D  deploy zone (roster placement)
//         1..9  spawn zone id (must lie on the map edge; used by simulation spawns, not by the roster)
// Layout notes: column 5 rows 2..7 is a straight wall; (8,3) is a free hex enclosed by six obstacles
// (an isolated "pocket" for reachability tests); (8,7)-(9,7) is a small rock.
@layout flat-top odd-q
@name Прототип 12×10 (flat-top)
@size 12 10
@base База игрока
@zone 1 Северный край
@zone 2 Восточный край

. . . . . . 1 1 1 . . .
. . . . . . . . . . . .
. . . . . # . # # # . .
. . . . . # . # . # . .
B B . . . # . . # . . 2
B D . . . # . . . . . 2
D . . . . # . . . . . 2
. . . . . # . . # # . .
. . . . . . . . . . . .
. . . . . . . . . . . .
